            <ArticleTitle>Physicians' knowledge and attitudes about coronary heart disease prevention guidelines and technology assisted interventions.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1079</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>BJC Healthcare is conducting a randomized controlled study to evaluate the impact of a technology-assisted pharmacist intervention on physicians' adherence to national coronary heart disease (CHD) prevention guidelines. We surveyed physicians to assess their knowledge of the guidelines and attitudes toward pharmacist-mediated interventions.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
